 habits"},{"k":"w","c":5,"s":"s5","m":"M23","tr":"sw","g":"sedge","n":"In nswt “king”, where it is written first.","p":"The gods by name"},{"k":"w","c":5,"s":"s6","m":"L2","tr":"bjt","g":"bee","n":"The north, in the title nswt-bjt.","p":"The five names of a king"},{"k":"w","c":5,"s":"s5","m":"G5","tr":"Ḥrw","g":"falcon","n":"Horus, and the first royal title.","p":"The gods by name"},{"k":"w","c":5,"s":"s6","m":"D28","tr":"kꜣ","g":"two raised arms","n":"The ka, the life force.","p":"The five names of a king"},{"k":"w","c":5,"s":"s5","m":"C10","tr":"mꜣꜥt","g":"goddess with a feather","n":"Maat: order, truth, justice.","p":"The gods by name"},{"k":"w","c":5,"s":"s6","m":"F12","tr":"wsr","g":"animal’s head and neck","n":"“powerful”.","p":"The five names of a king"},{"k":"w","c":5,"s":"s7","m":"N28","tr":"ḫꜥ","g":"sun rising over a hill","n":"“appear in glory”.","p":"Inside and around the cartouche"},{"k":"w","c":5,"s":"s7","m":"X8","tr":"dj","g":"cone-shaped loaf","n":"“give”, as in dj ꜥnḫ “given life”.","p":"Inside and around the cartouche"},{"k":"w","c":5,"s":"s6","m":"G16","tr":"nbtj","g":"vulture and cobra","n":"The Two Ladies: the second royal title.","p":"The five names of a king"},{"k":"w","c":5,"s":"s6","m":"M23:X1-L2:X1","tr":"nswt-bjt","g":"sedge and bee","n":"King of Upper and Lower Egypt: before the throne name.","p":"The five names of a king"},{"k":"w","c":5,"s":"s6","m":"G39-N5","tr":"zꜣ Rꜥ","g":"duck and sun","n":"“son of Ra”: before the birth name.","p":"The five names of a king"},{"k":"w","c":5,"s":"s4","m":"N16:N16","tr":"tꜣwj","g":"two strips of land","n":"“the Two Lands”: Egypt.","p":"Scribes' habits"},{"k":"w","c":5,"s":"s11","m":"X8-S34-I10:X1:N17","tr":"dj ꜥnḫ ḏt","g":"after a king’s name","n":"“given life forever”.","p":"Review deck"}]}